WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:18.520
Before the morning star was named,

2
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:24.940
before the covenant was sealed,

3
00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:32.580
a lamb laid on an altar stone

4
00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:37.220
and heaven began to say:

5
00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.800
He is coming.

6
00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:50.260
He is coming.

7
00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:57.380
Wait on the Lord — hold on.

8
00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:04.480
You have carried promises too —

9
00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:11.280
through silence and through wondering years.

10
00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:18.040
Those who hope and quietly wait

11
00:01:18.040 --> 00:01:23.760
are not forgotten — they are carried.

12
00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:31.220
Your strength will rise like eagles rising.

13
00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:37.460
Rest in Him and do not strive.

14
00:01:37.460 --> 00:01:43.940
You, too, Lord — keep Your word.

15
00:01:44.240 --> 00:01:45.680
He is coming.

16
00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:52.540
He is coming.

17
00:01:54.460 --> 00:02:00.860
Wait on the Lord — we will hold on.

18
00:02:00.860 --> 00:02:06.500
Mary said yes to what she could not see

19
00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:11.240
and treasured all she could not understand.

20
00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:19.680
Joseph said yes to what he did not know —

21
00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:25.460
heaven placed in mortal hands.

22
00:02:26.460 --> 00:02:29.480
He came. He came.

23
00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:32.840
The night that never went dark.

24
00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:38.060
She pondered these things in her heart —

25
00:02:39.460 --> 00:02:44.080
and so can you.

26
00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:48.860
He came. He came.

27
00:02:48.860 --> 00:02:52.460
God keeping His ancient word.

28
00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:57.060
Ponder these things in your heart.

29
00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:13.480
You have your own unspoken years,

30
00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:19.860
your own familiar bench and trade —

31
00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:27.560
ordinary days of faithful living,

32
00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:32.660
the hidden years inside His plan.

33
00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:40.860
He grew in wisdom and in stature,

34
00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:47.440
in favor with God and man.

35
00:03:47.440 --> 00:03:53.240
And so do you — in ways unseen,

36
00:03:53.280 --> 00:03:59.520
in every quiet, steady span.

37
00:04:00.860 --> 00:04:07.140
Mary said yes to what she could not see

38
00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:11.220
and treasured all she could not understand.

39
00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:19.700
Joseph said yes to what he did not know —

40
00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:25.440
heaven placed in mortal hands.

41
00:04:26.140 --> 00:04:29.840
He came. He came.

42
00:04:29.840 --> 00:04:33.040
The night that never went dark.

43
00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:37.560
She pondered these things in her heart —

44
00:04:39.520 --> 00:04:44.120
and so can you.

45
00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:49.060
He came. He came.

46
00:04:49.060 --> 00:04:52.220
God keeping His ancient word.

47
00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:57.320
Ponder these things in your heart.

48
00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:04.860
And when the time has come for you to leave

49
00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:11.000
the workbench and the road you know,

50
00:05:12.380 --> 00:05:18.120
trust in the Lord with all your heart —

51
00:05:19.320 --> 00:05:24.220
lean not on what you think you see.

52
00:05:26.940 --> 00:05:31.140
Acknowledge Him in all your ways

53
00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:37.620
and He will make the pathway clear.

54
00:05:38.220 --> 00:05:43.780
For we walk by faith and not by sight —

55
00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:51.920
this is the word He speaks to you right here.

56
00:06:02.660 --> 00:06:07.780
He said yes before the world began.

57
00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:15.840
She said yes in a Galilean town.

58
00:06:16.840 --> 00:06:22.620
And you — can say yes today,

59
00:06:22.620 --> 00:06:28.560
as all His promises come down.

60
00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:32.640
He came. He came.

61
00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:36.140
God keeping His word through it all.

62
00:06:36.140 --> 00:06:39.020
He came. He came —

63
00:06:39.020 --> 00:06:43.640
and nothing faithful will be small.

64
00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:55.420
Wait on the Lord.

65
00:06:55.420 --> 00:06:58.520
Be of good courage.

66
00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:01.640
He kept His word.

67
00:07:06.140 --> 00:07:08.640
Wait on the Lord.

68
00:07:09.480 --> 00:07:12.480
He will renew your strength.

69
00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:18.140
He always keeps His word.
